# Generated by `deno check`. Not committed: it pins integrity hashes for esm.sh
# URLs, which can be re-served with different bytes and fail CI for reasons that
# have nothing to do with this repo. The check exists to catch type errors in
# our own code, not to pin transitive types.
deno.lock
